  "title": "Epic Monsoon Ukrainian Garlicky, Juicy Stew",
  "description": "A hearty, garlicky Ukrainian dish featuring mirin-hon, perfect for a refreshing monsoon evening. Serve with some warm rye bread to mop up the juices.",
