  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a wok over medium-high heat. Add the beef brisket and sear until browned, about 5 minutes, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Add garlic and cook for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the mirin-hon, black pepper, and kosher salt. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the flour and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Gradually add the water, stirring constantly to prevent lumps.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer for 2 hours, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes and continue to simmer for another 30 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
